      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The system fit up was quick & by appearance done well. It was fitted up on March 6 & even today 12 April, I don’t know if it is connected to the grid. I had an Invincible employee perform some work on last Tuesday & I have not heard anything as yet. I was supposed to be provided with maintenance & warranty docs on Tuesday, I didn’t. I had trouble from the day it was fitted with signing off on the finance. What I was quoted as x $’s per week changed to monthly payments & exceeded what I agreed to. I was expected to sign a 20 page doc that had a lot of clauses that didn’t apply to what I signed off on in the installation agreement doc. They even sent communication to me threatening to send info to debt collectors!!! I never refused to sign off, I just wanted all ambiguity removed from what I was to sign.",
