      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I had an offer via PowerPal for a solar battery but thought it would be best to have two more quotes for comparison. I therefore asked SolarQuotes to contact two other solar installers. The two contacted me very quickly but their quotes were greater than PowerPal/Invincible Energy. I therefore told these two companies that I would be going with my original installer and that is what happened.Invincible Energy were very friendly and not pushy in any way. The electrician installed the battery within 4 hours but had to leave it turned off until an inspector checked things out. Unfortunately this inspector did not know that there was an enclosed fuse switch and did not turn this on. The unit was therefore not working and I had to eventually request the electrician to come back onsite. He actually rang me and told me where the \"hidden\" fuse switch was located. As soon as I turned that on the unit was fully operational.",
